{
  "description": "Exercises the scenario command path with the harness's own test-only commands (tests/Evenmere.Sim.Tests/Scenarios/HarnessCommands.cs): commands applied on the tick they name, in file order, goods landing in the island stock, a rejected command, and a command nothing serves.",
